data: {"type":"response.output_text.done","sequence_number":1346,"item_id":"msg_052eb8f295066ee1016b06b04398e087d18fb32925c2dedc4c","output_index":1,"content_index":0,"text":"{\"queries\":[],\"result_json\":\"{\\\"reviews\\\":[{\\\"actor\\\":\\\"wren\\\",\\\"decision\\\":\\\"develop\\\",\\\"ability\\\":null,\\\"reason\\\":\\\"The related-capability searches found gathering, eating and cultivation, but no equivalent food-preparation operation. Eating consumes food without preparing it; cultivation has a different function. Develop a general hand-breaking food operation, with trial and preparation modes, as the smallest equipment-free precursor. It can attempt a genuinely different physical presentation without inventing cooking equipment, fuel, water, improved nutrition or guaranteed success. Whether these roots yield to hand force must be resolved physically, not inferred from their name or edibility.\\\",\\\"specification\\\":\\\"Development handoff in this conversation: implement 'Hand-break food', parameterized by mode (trial, prepare, inspect, cancel), owned input stack ID, whole-unit quantity and optional work ID. Trial and preparation share one mechanism and implementation. Reuse and record the existing ownership, reach, food-lot, ageing, work-progress and event routines where applicable; reuse forest.eat for subsequent consumption, extending its food-lot handling only as necessary rather than claiming a new eating mechanism. Dependencies: an explicit deterministic hand-workability rule using material resistance, represented geometry and available hand force; processed-food lot support preserving nutrition, toxicity, origin and age; and persistent work/event records. If these mechanisms are missing, implement them in this handoff. Do not silently assign every edible material a successful result. For existing roots, author a conservative material response from the actual implementation facts; if those facts do not support hand-breaking, the executable outcome is an informative failed trial, not invented pieces or a cooking unlock. No implementation or review waiting advances time. Prerequisites: individual study completed, usable hands, reachable owned edible food, sufficient energy, and no concurrent reservation of the same units. No tools, heat, water, vessel or work surface is supplied or required for an in-hand attempt. This is not washing, sterilization, detoxification, peeling or cooking. Wren may target item-183-wren-2083 or item-111-wren-1316 only if still owned, accessible and eligible under their actual current food state; the older lot's displayed decay value alone does not establish safety. Never expose hidden spoilage or material values. Trial accepts one whole unit, costs one active round and 1 energy, and applies bounded hand force once while holding the food. Its physical result persists: if it fractures, retain the same edible quantity as a coarse-piece lot; if it does not, retain the intact or visibly deformed lot. Record observed resistance, fracture or deformation, not an unsupported safety conclusion. Prepare applies the same operation to each selected unit, one round and 1 energy per unit, retaining completed units individually. A prior trial is optional, not a separate mandatory assessment activity. Inspect costs one round and 0.2 energy and reports only observable form, quantity, work stage and visible deterioration; cancel takes no work energy and terminates unfinished work. Recheck prerequisites before each paid round; validation failures spend no work energy or ingredients. Reference inputs by stable item IDs and work by stable work IDs, never resource-name substitution. Reserve rather than duplicate input units. Each completed unit is atomically transferred to an output lot with its original owner, source, harvest age, decay state, nutrition and toxicity. Represent coarse pieces as the same food quantity with changed form, not several new nutrition-bearing units. For a root unit, retain its applicable existing nutrition of 14 before existing deterioration rules, not 14 per fragment; no bonus calories, lower toxicity, freshness reset or keeping-quality improvement. Any detached inedible or spoiled portion must remain accounted for as waste with its associated mass and nutritional share, never disappear or become free food. Output is uncooked food in its actual resulting form; failed attempts may leave unchanged food and do not count as successful preparation. Existing eating costs and nutrition rules apply only upon subsequent actual consumption. No tasting is included automatically. Do not guarantee a changed eating experience merely because the shape changes. Work tracks selected units, remaining units, spent energy, completed outputs and physical condition. Insufficient energy, unusable hands, loss of reach or an unworked round pauses before the next unit without charge. Resume by work ID after revalidation; food continues ageing during ordinary elapsed world time, including pauses. Cancellation releases unworked reserved food once and leaves completed outputs unchanged. Death leaves surviving inputs and outputs at the death location under existing possession rules, with no duplication. Lost or spoiled inputs cannot be replaced for free. Paid effort is never refunded; unspent energy was never debited. No autonomous production, fire or other ongoing process continues after a step. Products need no special maintenance beyond ordinary handling and existing spoilage rules; no preservation effect is added. Do not grant inventory, consent, mastery, permissions or a change to protected reward accounts, goals or budgets.\\\",\\\"learning\\\":2,\\\"experienceReview\\\":\\\"Study takes 2 individually completed rounds at 0.2 energy per round; requesting, registration, study completion and mastery award no pleasure or satisfaction. A paid trial can produce verified information about this material's response to hand force, including informative failure. Record only that evidence, keyed by operation, material, relevant condition and outcome so repeated queries or equivalent trials cannot farm novelty. This minimal capability awards no direct pleasure or satisfaction and changes no protected reward account. Later actual eating may use the established meal-experience implementation, based on personal applicability, real consumed food, existing bounded amounts, meal window, cooldown, decay and functional deduplication; neither a new label nor a new shape alone qualifies for a variety bonus. Familiar legitimate eating remains eligible under existing rules. No comfort increase is specified, physical comfort remains capped at 10, and basic nutrition is never reduced by mood.\\\",\\\"visualReview\\\":\\\"Emit reusable observable events for work started, hand force applied, food fractured, food deformed, attempt resisted, work paused, resumed, cancelled and completed. Include actor ID, stable input/output/work IDs, visible quantity, current form, location, progress and outcome; do not include hidden safety or resistance values. Use reusable food-lot visual metadata such as component=food, form=whole/coarse-pieces/deformed, material palette, visible deterioration and quantity. Show coarse pieces only after an actual fracture event and completed preparation only for units actually processed successfully. Paused work retains its true intermediate state; an intact resisted root must not show a prepared-meal success icon. No steam, fire, cooking vessel, washed appearance or celebratory wellbeing effect is justified.\\\"}]}\"}","logprobs":[]}

